    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Julie K.",
        "date": "2024-12-11T16:34:38Z",
        "id": "6759bf1e2875ee6f11c6c0af",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Dec 16, 2024",
            "id": "6a8b8f09-786c-4c6f-8f4c-94cd84385919",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Julie, thank you for sharing your experience at Adrift Afloat. We are absolutely thrilled that we could provide a wonderful property for you and your family. We are so glad we could make a good impression on you. We hope to have you stay with Oversee again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Very nice property and well maintained. My family, my parents and my sisters family enjoyed a lovely week at this house. Plenty of room for our party of eleven to spread out. Lots of porches that are well furnished to hang out on as well as the lovely pool space. The management company was super responsive, especially given that it was a busy holiday week. Questions were answered near instantly and when needed they were at the property within minutes!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Wonderful week",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "William M.",
        "date": "2024-09-23T18:01:34Z",
        "id": "66f1acfe4d6d16507152e193",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Oct 8, 2024",
            "id": "da13c964-30de-4dca-82ce-e104faace4d9",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi William, thank you for sharing your experience at Adrift Afloat. We are thrilled to hear you and your family enjoyed our wonderful property. We are glad you enjoyed our amenities and we truly hope to have you stay with Oversee again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Good space for family. Beautiful pool area. Carriage house provided nice space for family with 15 month old. Clean kitchen. Great gas grill. Nicely stocked with starter toiletries, dish soap, laundry pods. Great welcome gifts in beach blankets and travel cups.\n\nOkay beach access once Rams public access was located. East Lake access was difficult due to lake runoff for 82 year old mother.\n\nLast minute booking was well managed by management company. Great communication to ensure booking was confirmed. We would stay in this property again.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Family Beach Week",
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "author": "Kelsie H.",
        "date": "2025-07-03T20:56:03Z",
        "id": "6866fce40e5be80bf0819ecb",
        "label": "Poor",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 4,
        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Jul 18, 2025",
            "id": "c91548fc-80cc-46be-b282-008ab97bfb8e",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your experience, Kelsie. We are disappointed to hear your stay was anything but perfect, but we are happy to hear our team treated you all well. We will have our team take a look at items that can be replaced and stock the kitchen with more items. We hope to have you stay with Oversee again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our large family stayed at Adrift Afloat in June. The home was exceedingly large with enough space, bedrooms, and porches for all to fit comfortably. However, the home felt like a RENTAL that was in dire need of some TLC. Stains were on the furniture, carpet, rugs, blinds, and curtains. Most of the patio furniture was either rusted, torn, or had paint chipping. The most disappointing was the small size of the pool and lack of a stocked kitchen. The listing says it sleeps 20, but there was not enough silverware of matching dishes for that many people. The pool was also very crowded. With that said, the property management was great. They came and swapped out a leaky faucet and delivered hot spots when the internet was having issues. Overall, we would not stay here again - not what I expect when we think of 30A beach luxury!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Check-in, communication",
          "Disliked: Cleanliness, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "title": "Large House, But Felt Dingy and Dated",
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
